{{Quote|Wielded by a proficient swordsman, it is small yet powerful.|Item}}
The '''Dark Dagger''' is a {{Legendary}} [[sword]].

Being accurate to its description, the Dark Dagger has very flexible combos, being highly compatible with [[Godhuman]]. Its moves have small hitboxes however, so it needs a high amount of precision to land the abilities.

==Obtainment==
The Dark Dagger has a 5% chance to be dropped after defeating [[rip_indra True Form]].

