==Trivia==
* The Dark Dagger is currently the smallest [[sword]] in the game in terms of its model size, although it does not have a small hitbox in its click attacks.
* The Dark Dagger has the same click animation as the [[Dark Blade]], but smaller.
* If the user times it right, they can land a melee attack during {{Ability|Z}}.
* Before [[Update 24]], while the Dark Dagger is worn, it seems to take the appearance of a golden cross or crucifix.
* There is currently a glitch where if the user uses {{Ability|Z}}, they will land the attack but phase through the player, preventing the user from following up with any other skill.
** This can be avoided, however, by simply turning around after landing the hit.

